{%- comment -%}
One chapter's entry in a search index (search-index/<sthāna>.json).
Usage:  {% include search-entry.json chapter=c %}

The chapter is split into "segments" in reading order, each tagged with
its register, so the combined eTexts search can look in the mūla, the
commentaries and the notes separately or together:
  "m"  mūla              <div class="mula">
  "c"  commentary        any other top-level <div> (bhasya, aruna,
                         hemadri, adhamalla, kasirama, vyakhya, ...)
  "n"  note              each <li> of <section class="notes">

Inline footnote references are dropped first: their digits would
otherwise land in the middle of the text ("sahasrākṣaṃ 1 gaṇādhīśaṃ")
and break phrase searches. Liquid has no regex, so we split on the
<sup> markup and keep only what follows each closing tag.

This file is identical in every text; keep the copies in step.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign raw = include.chapter.content | split: '<sup' -%}
{%- capture body -%}{{ raw[0] }}{% for p in raw offset:1 %}{{ p | split: '</sup>' | last }}{% endfor %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign halves = body | split: '<section class="notes"' -%}
{%- capture segs -%}
{%- assign blocks = halves[0] | split: '<div class="' -%}
{%- for b in blocks -%}
{%- if forloop.first -%}
{%- assign reg = "m" -%}{%- assign t = b | strip_html | normalize_whitespace -%}
{%- else -%}
{%- assign cls = b | split: '"' | first -%}
{%- if cls == "mula" -%}{%- assign reg = "m" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign reg = "c" -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign t = b | prepend: '<div class="' | strip_html | normalize_whitespace -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if t != "" -%},["{{ reg }}",{{ t | jsonify }}]{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if halves.size > 1 -%}
{%- assign items = halves[1] | split: '<li' -%}
{%- for n in items offset:1 -%}
{%- assign t = n | prepend: '<li' | strip_html | remove: '&#8617;' | normalize_whitespace -%}
{%- if t != "" -%},["n",{{ t | jsonify }}]{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{"title": {{ include.chapter.title | jsonify }},"adhyaya": {{ include.chapter.adhyaya | jsonify }},"url": {{ include.chapter.url | relative_url | jsonify }},"segs": [{{ segs | remove_first: ',' }}]}
